<newsitem itemid="165985" id="root" date="1996-11-05" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Edgars half-year shr falls, div held.</title>
<headline>Edgars half-year shr falls, div held.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to end September</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     271	   vs 292</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 67	    vs 67</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   145.1	 vs 153.2</p>
<p>    Trading profit	  249.0	 vs 273.3</p>
<p>    Financing costs	 30.3	  vs 41.8</p>
<p>    Dividend income	  -	    vs 0.7</p>
<p>    Tax			 75.5	  vs 81.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		  2,785.9     vs 2,425.1</p>
<p>    Retail sales	    2,659.9     vs 2,318.9</p>
<p>Div payable December 31</p>
<p>on register November 22</p>
<p>Full name: Edgars Stores Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company will offer capitalisation shares in lieu of the cash dividend determined by the ratio that 67 cents multiplied by 1.06 bears to the closing price of the shares on December 20 averaged with the closing prices on the three previous business days.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
